  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Views, Views, Views ... of the stunning Gulf of Mexico, from this Beautiful 5 bedroom, 6 bath home in the gated community of Cypress Dunes on 30a! Take the elevator to the Top floor, which features a large kitchen and dining area to seat 10 or more. Kitchen is a cook's dream, with 6-burner gas stove, oven, warming drawer, microwave/convection oven and all the accessories expected by a gourmet cook! Kitchen is highlighted with a large island complete with 4 swivel stools all overlooking the ocean! Nearby is a sitting area with a desk and wet bar featuring ice-maker, dual temp control refrigerator for soft drinks and wine, topped by a nice coffee bar with bean grinder and lots of conversation cups.<br>The third floor features a large great room with pine ceiling, cozy fireplace and plenty of seating and room for the family to watch the big game on a surround-sound TV. But you'll probably be \"distracted\" by the views just outside the window on the covered deck that includes a wood-pellet grill.<br>The second floor features three bedrooms, each with an ensuite bathroom. The spacious master bedroom offers a separate outside porch perfect to hide away and read a book while catching glimpses of Topsail Park and the gulf. Soak in the large soaking tub overlooking the forest and ocean in the master bathroom which is beautifully appointed with a separate shower and bathtub, separate vanities and seating for a make-up area.<br>Enter this exquisite home on the first floor where you treated to a cheery entry and access to two bedrooms and two full baths. The bunk room features two queen beds across from two twin beds. Next door is a fun kids/family bedroom and living area complete with games and large flat screen TV. Open the back door to the patio, which offers 4 adirondak chairs surrounding a fire pit looking out at Topsail State Park where you can often see deer prancing through.<br>Guests have access to the garage which features shelves of beach accessories, chairs and 4 bicycles. <br>Grab tennis or pickleball rackets and head for the tennis courts just a couple of blocks away. Or take some beach toys to the large amenity center just a few houses down. There you'll enjoy a giant infinity swimming pool, large group-sized hot tub, gym/workout room and lots of loungers to hang out for hours. The pool is heated most vacation weeks! Guests also have access to a second pool in nearby phase 2. Just jump on a bicycle and ride the safe streets and boardwalks throughout the Cypress Dunes community. Or if you want to head from the beach, put on a back-pack chair and ride your bike about 1 mile to the Stallworth beach access, or in Topsail State Park.Book now! What are you waiting for? Peace, tranquility and fun are awaiting you now!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "VIEWS!\nIncredible views from this brand new 5 bedroom home in Santa Rosa Beach!"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
